    scripture: ["Ephesians 1:3-14", "Psalm 139:13-16"], more: ["John 1:12", "1 Peter 2:9-10", "2 Corinthians 5:17"], memory: "John 1:12",
    objectives: ["Describe what Scripture says about identity in Christ", "Name false sources of identity", "Practise answering lies with truth"],
